%% Figure: Authentication + email one-time-password (OTP) MFA
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Login / Verify2FA
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Send as send-mfa-code
    participant Verify as verify-mfa-code
    participant Mail as Email (SMTP)
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    User->>UI: email + password
    UI->>Auth: signInWithPassword
    Auth-->>UI: JWT session (MFA pending)
    UI->>Send: invoke (user)
    Send->>DB: store hashed OTP + expiry
    Send->>Mail: deliver 6-digit code
    Mail-->>User: OTP email
    User->>UI: enter 6-digit code
    UI->>Verify: invoke (code)
    Verify->>DB: check code + expiry + attempts
    alt valid
        Verify-->>UI: verified -> grant access
        UI-->>User: redirect to dashboard
    else invalid / expired
        Verify-->>UI: rejected
        UI-->>User: retry / resend
    end
